---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Premium Domain Valuation Guide 2026 | What Is sdl.rentals Worth? | SDL";
const description =
  "How premium domains like sdl.rentals are valued: length, extension, geo + vertical match, Scottsdale rental demand, comps ($25k–$120k), and how to make a winning offer via secure escrow.";
const image =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA/3e5fb84a-7803-415b-daf5-4d21bdcca700/public";
const favicon =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA/3e5fb84a-7803-415b-daf5-4d21bdcca700/public";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  image={image}
  favicon={favicon}
  canonicalPath="/valuation-guide/"
  keywords="domain valuation guide, premium domain worth, how to value a domain, investment domains, expired domains, brandable domains, buy .rentals domains"
>
  <main id="main" class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-200">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-700 hover:underline">← Back to sdl.rentals</a>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-amber-700">Valuation Guide • Updated 2026</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">
        What makes sdl.rentals a premium domain?
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Ten characters, geo-premium prefix, exact-vertical extension, and a top-decile rental market.
        Here’s exactly how sophisticated buyers underwrite it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Scarcity: 3 + 7, pronounceable, exact-meaning</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        SDL = Scottsdale shorthand; rentals = the entire category. Short geo + vertical domains with
        clear semantics trade at multiples of longer alternatives. There is exactly one sdl.rentals.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Extension fit: .rentals beats generic</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        For vacation, luxury, and long-term rental brands, .rentals converts intent better than a forced .com.
        It tells guests and owners what you do instantly — higher recall, cheaper branded search, instant category ownership.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Market: Scottsdale rental demand</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>11M+ visitors in 2024; $3.7B economic impact.</li>
        <li>Luxury resorts, golf communities, Old Town + North Scottsdale demand.</li>
        <li>Strong short-term (Airbnb/VRBO) + premium long-term + snowbird base.</li>
        <li>Affluent second-home owners seeking professional management.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Comps: $25k–$120k</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Publicly reported premium geo + travel/rental exact-match sales (2023–2026) cluster $25k–$120k
        depending on length and commercial intent. sdl.rentals is offered at market — asking $100,000.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. How to make a winning offer</h2>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-1">
        <li>State intended use (vacation platform, luxury brand, management, marketplace…).</li>
        <li>Lead with your best number — the asking price is $100,000.</li>
        <li>Confirm escrow + timeline (push vs. Auth-code).</li>
        <li>Ask about bundles (sdlrealtor.com, sdl.contact, sdl.life) for leverage.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 p-8 text-center dark:bg-black dark:border dark:border-white/10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Underwrite it yourself — then own it.</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Confidential, escrow-protected, 24–48h response.</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/#inquire-offer" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white px-8 font-semibold text-slate-900">Make an Offer →</a>
          <a href="/faq/" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-white/25 px-8 font-semibold text-white">Read buying FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
